<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '60px', flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative' }}>

    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 56, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>唐—宋:斗拱成为铺作层</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C9DAF3', letterSpacing: 1 }}>03 · 形制演变</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 520, marginTop: 24, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

        <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 84, background: '#E8EFF8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24, borderLeft: '4px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', letterSpacing: 2, width: 96 }}>关键转变</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>
                柱头斗拱所承托的梁插入斗拱之中,斗拱不再是孤立的托架,而成为水平框架"铺作层"上不可分割的节点。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 300, flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 24, gap: 24 }}>

            <Box style={{ width: 500, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderRight: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingRight: 32 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>铺作层的作用</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    一圈柱头枋与正、侧两面的梁交织成井字格水平框架,斗拱处在每个交叉点上。
                    这个框架把一圈柱子锁成一个整体,是木构架整体性的关键。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 12 }}>
                    佛光寺东大殿是这一做法的典型实例;保国寺大殿则处在"厅堂型"与"殿堂型"之间的过渡形态。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 8 }}>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 72, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>1/2</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 10 }}>斗拱高约占柱高</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>唐代比例,宋代渐降至 2/7</Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 72, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>1–2</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 10 }}>柱间补间铺作朵数</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>明清增至 4–8 朵</Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 72, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>3–4</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 10 }}>出檐深度(米)</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>佛光寺单栱出挑即达 2 米</Text>
                </Box>

            </Box>

        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 88, marginTop: 24, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                1103 年,《营造法式》成书,把上述经验写成可执行的规范:
                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>以"材"为模数,以"分"为最小单位</span>,单材栱断面定为 15 分 × 10 分。
            </Text>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, right: 60, top: 672, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>斗拱:形制、受力与千年演变</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>14 / 20</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
